OL,3,GNEWSAMassive wasps' nest in wildlife
OL,4,Aoffice dismantled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nature reserve manager has finally
OL,7,Fdismantled a large wasps' nest in her
OL,8,Foffice after the insects made it their
OL,9,Fhome for four months.
OL,11,FEilish Rothney, a nature reserve
OL,12,Fmanager for the Trinity Broads at the
OL,13,FNorfolk Wildlife Trust, found wasps
OL,14,Fbuzzing around the room in June, when
OL,15,Fshe returned from conducting surveys.
OL,17,FThe wasps had made their home on the
OL,18,Fshelves of the Ormesby St Michael
OL,19,Foffice, wrapping around binders and
OL,20,Fother items. They left the nest a few
OL,21,Fweeks ago.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
