OL,3,GNEWSAMassive wasps' nest in wildlife
OL,4,Aoffice dismantled
OL,5,
OL,6,FRothney said: "It's kind of a fitting
OL,7,Ftribute that we've welcomed what many,
OL,8,Fmany people see as a pest...and we've
OL,9,Fhelped them survive, which will help
OL,10,Fthis whole ecosystem that we rely on."
